{"publicId":"7b6845d6-9c29-4e84-b1e1-3b25132aef00","title":"美团三季报凸显全球增长加速，市场关注财报细节","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T02:34:03.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T02:34:03.000Z","digest":"美团三季报将重点展示全球市场增长加速趋势，目前市场预期其海外业务收入同比增幅超30%。\n\n该趋势源于美团东南亚及拉美市场的订单量同比增长超40%，同时其本地生活服务在欧美市场的渗透率从8%提升至15%。不过，部分机构指出，上述增长中约60%依赖跨境支付手续费率下降，而非实际业务扩张，且该效应或于2027年Q1后消退。\n\n最新数据显示，美团国际版App月活用户达2200万，较半年前增长65%，但主要增长来自印尼和巴西市场，中国区海外订单占比仍不足5%。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T02:52:53.326Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"美团三季报前瞻：全球增长加速成焦点","latestReport":{"id":"p9kib3lj42j2v7qt02xniae6i"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fvxIRxCAYl1k","title":"美团三季报前瞻：全球增长加速成焦点","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T02:34:03.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"p9kib3lj42j2v7qt02xniae6i","title":"美团三季报前瞻：全球增长加速成焦点","summary":"美团三季报将重点关注全球市场增长加速的趋势。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T02:34:03.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"p9kib3lj42j2v7qt02xniae6i","title":"美团三季报前瞻：全球增长加速成焦点","summary":"美团三季报将重点关注全球市场增长加速的趋势。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T02:34:03.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T06:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T08:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T10:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T11:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T13:00:00